{
  "slug": "postmortem-writing",
  "concept": "Postmortem Writing",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "A postmortem is a learning artifact disguised as an incident report. It must satisfy three audiences simultaneously: the engineers who need to understand what failed, the leadership who need to evalua",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A postmortem is a learning artifact disguised as an incident report. It must satisfy three audiences simultaneously: the engineers who need to understand what failed, the leadership who need to evaluate organizational risk, and the people who lived through the incident.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. Blameless framing in prose — the system, not the human",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Three substitutions do most of the work:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#1-blameless-framing-in-prose-the-system-not-the-human",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Names → roles. \"Alice deployed the bad change\" → \"The release engineer deployed change #4821.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#1-blameless-framing-in-prose-the-system-not-the-human",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Judgments → actions. \"Bob failed to notice the alert\" → \"The on-call engineer did not see the alert because it was routed to a paused channel.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#1-blameless-framing-in-prose-the-system-not-the-human",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Causal verbs → enabling conditions. \"X caused Y\" → \"X created conditions under which Y became possible.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#1-blameless-framing-in-prose-the-system-not-the-human",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "The single most damaging phrase: \"should have.\" Replace it with \"the system did not surface the information that would have enabled X.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#1-blameless-framing-in-prose-the-system-not-the-human",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Timeline reconstruction in UTC",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "UTC timestamps, always.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#2-timeline-reconstruction-in-utc",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Source for each event: which dashboard, which log line, which Slack message.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#2-timeline-reconstruction-in-utc",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Actor + action + observable result, in that order.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#2-timeline-reconstruction-in-utc",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Decision points called out explicitly, with the information the decider had at the time.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#2-timeline-reconstruction-in-utc",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Contributing factors vs root cause",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Real incidents have a root cause plus contributing factors. Structure the analysis as:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Triggering event (the proximate change).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Root cause (the latent defect the trigger exposed).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Contributing factors, categorized:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Technical (missing monitoring, single points of failure)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "Process (insufficient testing, communication gaps)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "Environmental (time pressure, on-call fatigue)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#3-contributing-factors-vs-root-cause",
          "note": null,
          "level": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Five Whys discipline",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Apply iteratively: \"Why did the API return 503s? Because the database connection pool was exhausted.\" Continue until you reach an organizational or design-level factor.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#4-five-whys-discipline",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Allow branching. A single chain of whys is rare. Multiple parallel chains converging on multiple contributing factors is common.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#4-five-whys-discipline",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Action items with owners, dates, severity, and traceability",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A defensible action item has:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#5-action-items-with-owners-dates-severity-and-traceability",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Owner: a single named person (not a team).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#5-action-items-with-owners-dates-severity-and-traceability",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Due date: a real calendar date.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#5-action-items-with-owners-dates-severity-and-traceability",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Severity / priority: P0/P1/P2 calibrated to actual risk reduction.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#5-action-items-with-owners-dates-severity-and-traceability",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Traceability: which contributing factor it addresses.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#5-action-items-with-owners-dates-severity-and-traceability",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Definition of done: how the writer will know the action is complete.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#5-action-items-with-owners-dates-severity-and-traceability",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. \"What went well\" without performative positivity",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "What worked: the alert fired correctly, the rollback procedure was executable.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#6-what-went-well-without-performative-positivity",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "What we got lucky on: things that worked but only by accident.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#6-what-went-well-without-performative-positivity",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "What we want to preserve: practices that should be formalized.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#6-what-went-well-without-performative-positivity",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. Hindsight bias — naming it and writing around it",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Linguistic markers of hindsight bias to delete in revision:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#7-hindsight-bias-naming-it-and-writing-around-it",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Clearly...\" (it was not clear at the time).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#7-hindsight-bias-naming-it-and-writing-around-it",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Obviously...\" (it was not obvious to anyone in the moment).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#7-hindsight-bias-naming-it-and-writing-around-it",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Should have noticed...\" (replace with \"the available signals did not surface X\").",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#7-hindsight-bias-naming-it-and-writing-around-it",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "8. The hourglass structure for postmortems",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The top (inverted pyramid summary, 4–6 paragraphs). The verdict first: what broke, when, who was affected, severity, root cause class.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#8-the-hourglass-structure-for-postmortems",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The turn (one sentence). \"Here is how the incident unfolded, in chronological order.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#8-the-hourglass-structure-for-postmortems",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The bottom (chronological narrative). The timeline.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#8-the-hourglass-structure-for-postmortems",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Single-root-cause syndrome: \"the root cause was X\" with no contributing factors.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Wishlist action items: \"we should also rewrite the deployment system.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Hindsight prose: \"obviously the team should have noticed...\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The publish-and-forget: no review date, no owner for action items.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/postmortem-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
